 - 2026-06-25: PHASE A1 (ARC NORTH STAR; PRIMARY; HEADLINE; operator highest-leverage 2026-06-24 "build it") -- LEADER'S GOAL-FREE ONLINE ACTION-LEARNING DRIVER, tested VALIDLY for the FIRST time. The .433 (exp4710) and .434 (exp4715) attempts BOTH ran degenerate/dead code (all-arms-identical 0.04 = TAUTOLOGY/no-op), so the leader's loop has NEVER been validly tested. Build the corrected driver: an online binary-frame-change CNN with a COORDINATE HEAD that PROPOSES clicks (hierarchical action-then-coord sample, NOT a re-ranker), self-supervised free labels (frame_changed), Adam lr=1e-4 BCE every ~5 actions, hash-deduped buffer, reward-driven per-level reset to the cross-game PRIOR (not random). TWO-STAGE GATE: (1) PROVE the arms are non-degenerate (distinct action distributions + non-zero online train-steps; NOT byte-identical first-win) -- else complete: online_driver_arms_degenerate_confirmed_harness_bug (a BUG, not a capability null); (2) only then, online-warm beats frozen by >=+0.05 held-out first-win OR a multi-level probe (lp85/sc25) reaches L2 offline-reproduced. CPU train-step ms MEASURED. live_agent_self_discovery. verifier_is_oracle:false. retire_if_same_verdict. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: online_action_learning_no_first_win_lift_residual_online_signal_genuinely_too_sparse; results/experiment_4726_online_action_learning_driver_valid_test.json
 - 2026-06-25: PHASE A2 (ARC NORTH STAR; PRIMARY; the capstone + SOTA hand-off -- ACT to disambiguate) -- HYPOTHESIS-DRIVEN ACTIVE-PROBE DISAMBIGUATION. The .434 A2 (exp4713) proved the present winner (coverage 1.0) is NOT separable from same-depth distractors by ANY static oracle-distinct feature (precision_at_k_delta=0.0) -- static selection is EXHAUSTED. The principled answer: the agent ACTS to disambiguate. E3AgentPolicy keeps a posterior over candidate goal/dynamics hypotheses, asks arc_executable_world_model what transition each predicts, and takes information-gain actions that SPLIT the posterior -- so the present-but-unseparable winner becomes distinguishable by its observed CONSEQUENCE, not a static feature. The energy verifier scores which probe best splits the posterior (oracle-distinct). Gate: the GENERIC agent reaches a NEW level via active probing on >=1 clean L1 game, offline-reproduced, with the NO-PROBE (passive) ablation FAILING. arXiv:2506.01876 + 2309.08477. live_path-reachable. live_agent_self_discovery. verifier_is_oracle:false. retire_if_same_verdict. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: active_probe_no_new_level_residual_budget_insufficient; results/experiment_4727_active_probe_disambiguation.json
